%%center The Cam-French Tune Collection
%%vskip 1cm
%%textfont Helvetica 14
%%begintext center
- being a collection of tunes which we play, enjoy, would like to play,
can't play, need to learn, can't stand playing any more, and sundry
others which have crossed our path -
